abstract: "Data and code for a cross-sectional analysis of drug interaction guidance in the US prescribing information of the 15 FDA-approved antibody-drug conjugates, coding where payload interaction liabilities appear (Section 12.3 versus Section 7), the evidence behind Section 7 guidance, and consistency among products sharing a payload. Labels were retrieved from DailyMed on November 12, 2026."
